== 2. My probes for #388, run again: zsh probe-388.sh <dir> <binary>; zsh probe-388m.sh <dir> <binary> (Run) ==
J, K, L and M are fixed. probe-388.sh's K now sleeps 1.2 s before it writes the
transcript line: the line is stamped to the second, and must not be older than the role.
Without it K fails by my probe's timing, on any build.

